        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anthropic (Claude)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any Linux machine you can reach over SSH. Deckhand can create a secure key for it on this iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeder Linux-Rechner, den du per SSH erreichst. Deckhand kann dafür auf diesem iPhone einen sicheren Schlüssel erzeugen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any MCP server with a streamable HTTP endpoint.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeder MCP-Server mit Streamable-HTTP-Endpunkt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anyone who gets into such an account is root at once. Fine for automation accounts, risky for people.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wer in so ein Konto kommt, ist sofort root. Okay für Automatisierungskonten, riskant für Menschen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anything using %@ is interrupted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alles, was %@ nutzt, wird unterbrochen."
