      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was passiert"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What should happen on %@?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was soll auf %@ passieren?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whisper large-v3": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Who's committing": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wer committet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With automatic security updates the server patches itself every day, even when you don't look.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mit automatischen Sicherheitsupdates patcht sich der Server jeden Tag selbst, auch wenn du nicht hinschaust."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Work in…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arbeiten in …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working in %@. Runs with your %@ subscription on the server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arbeitet in %1$@. Läuft mit deinem %2$@-Abo auf dem Server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working in %@. The agent asks before it changes anything.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arbeitet in %@. Der Agent fragt, bevor er etwas ändert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your branch and the remote have both moved on. Ask an agent to merge or rebase them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Branch und das Remote haben sich beide weiterentwickelt. Lass einen Agenten mergen oder rebasen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your current session stays open. Other SSH clients and scripts need the new port afterwards.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine aktuelle Sitzung bleibt offen. Andere SSH-Clients und Skripte brauchen danach den neuen Port."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your key": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your model key": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Modell-Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own API key": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eigener API-Schlüssel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own-key agent uses enabled connections right away. For Codex and Claude Code, open a server's tools and tap Sync.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Agent mit eigenem Key nutzt aktive Verbindungen sofort. Für Codex und Claude Code öffne die Server-Werkzeuge und tippe auf Übertragen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your server is set up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Server ist eingerichtet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your servers, in your pocket": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Server in der Hosentasche"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your user can't talk to Docker. Add it to the docker group: sudo usermod -aG docker $USER (then log in again).": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Benutzer darf Docker nicht nutzen. Füge ihn der Gruppe docker hinzu: sudo usermod -aG docker $USER (danach neu anmelden)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "fail2ban bans addresses that keep failing to log in, which stops password guessing and keeps logs readable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "fail2ban sperrt Adressen, die sich immer wieder falsch anmelden. Das stoppt Passwort-Raten und hält die Logs lesbar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "for %@ on %@. Deckhand keeps it in memory until you quit the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "für %1$@ auf %2$@. Deckhand behält es nur im Speicher, bis du die App beendest."
          }
        }
      }
    },
